{"_id":"6a2ff4232204ffbc59e5a534","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"xHDrwKDE_mrSihCsPQMBF","description":"# Linear Algebra Basics\n\nNumPy provides linear algebra operations, including matrix multiplication (`np.dot`, `@`), matrix inversion, determinants, and eigenvalues. These are used in statistics (covariance matrices), machine learning (feature transformations), and scientific computing. Understanding the basics of matrix operations is useful for reading ML algorithm implementations.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Numpy Linear Algebra","url":"https://www.programiz.com/python-programming/numpy/linear-algebra","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebe5"},{"type":"video","title":"Learn NumPy in 1 hour! ≡ƒöó","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXU4LSAQDSc","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebe6"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:46:27.433Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/xHDrwKDE_mrSihCsPQMBF.md"}